 "notes": [
  "Commodity Insights is renamed 'Energy' in this release (code CI).",
  "Exhibit 1 prints 'Other income, net' as a bracketed number (income) -> oth_inc positive.",
  "Corporate unallocated expense in the segment exhibit includes the $270 million gain on disposition (three and twelve months), so corp is negative (a credit) in Q4; corp_nongaap uses OP add-back sign (gain removed -> negative).",
  "seg_other.eq_deal_amort (extra key) = deal-related amortization within equity in income of unconsolidated subsidiaries.",
  "Balance sheet: assets / liabilities held for sale relate to the Enterprise Data Management and thinkFolio divestitures (Market Intelligence) and the Centennial, Colorado facility.",
  "Capex and NCI distributions recorded as positive costs; fcf_items as printed.",
  "2026 outlook (this release) is adjusted only, except reported revenue growth and capex; GAAP guidance deferred until the Mobility spin. Guidance assumes Mobility contributes for the full year. Adjusted free cash flow excluding certain items expected to grow mid-single digits.",
  "Exhibit 1 'Expenses' (2,511) excludes gain on dispositions (270) and equity in income (loss of 1); segment exhibit 'Total expenses' (2,242) nets both.",
  "Equity in income on unconsolidated subsidiaries is a loss of 1 in Q4-25 (printed 1 in the expense line) -> eq_inc = -1.",
  "Exhibit 5 adjusted net income prints only an aggregate 'Non-GAAP adjustments' line (-34 after tax, $(0.11)/share). Pre-tax: operating -89, interest -6 (premium amortization benefit) = -95; tax on non-GAAP adjustments -61 (printed).",
  "RELEASE DOES NOT TIE: footnote items after tax sum to -36 (computed, incl. +2 for the GAAP tax-rate item (h)), vs -34 printed; footnote tax effects sum to -59 vs -61 printed. Hence start_ni + items_net + amort_net = 1,297 vs adjusted NI 1,299 printed (check_rec flags 2.0). Published numbers kept.",
  "Ratings footnote (b) items sum to 9 pre-tax vs Non-GAAP adjustments 10 printed; corporate footnote (f) sums to -148 vs -149 printed (company rounding).",
  "Adjusted interest expense printed 61 vs 54 + 6 = 60 (computed; rounding).",
  "Deal-related amortization pre-tax 267 = segments 264 + corporate 2 + equity-method 1; tax 68; after tax 199.",
  "Tax item (h): tax expense of $2 million due to annualized effective tax rate differences for GAAP, recorded as net +2.",
  "Cash flow is twelve months year to date; three-month FCF from Exhibit 7 recorded with _q suffix (Q4 includes acquisition-related prepayment of (48), reversing the Q3 add-back)."
 ],
